# D3.js Legends

## Overview
Legends help users understand the meaning of colors, sizes, and other visual encodings in a visualization. D3 doesn't have a built-in legend component, but they're straightforward to create.

## Color Legend for Categorical Data

### Basic Color Legend
```javascript
const legend = svg.append("g")
    .attr("class", "legend")
    .attr("transform", `translate(${width - 150}, 20)`);

const legendItems = legend.selectAll(".legend-item")
    .data(categories)
    .join("g")
